# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deny by default.
#
# This repo publishes the ten skills of the engineering standard. The
# live skill store is ~/skills (via ~/.agents/skills); third-party skills
# are installed there, never vendored here.
#
# To publish another skill of your own, add it under "Published skills".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

# Repository files
!/AGENTS.md
!/ATTRIBUTION.md
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/skills.json
!/install-skills.sh

# Release tooling, the commit gate, and CI
!/scripts/
!/.githooks/
!/.github/

# Published skills
!/agent-rules/
!/code-discovery/
!/design/
!/project-scaffold/
!/repo-align/
!/repo-init/
!/skills-install/
!/standard/
!/verify-change/
!/workflow/

# Junk that must never enter a published skill.
#
# The allowlist above un-ignores each skill directory whole, which also
# un-ignores everything inside it. These rules go last so they win.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.venv/
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.swp
*~
